The '''Tosste Spur''' was a [[Hyperspace route|trade route]] that branched off from the [[Rimma Trade Route]]. The [[Outer Rim Territories]] [[planet]] [[Mustafar]] in the [[Atravis sector]]'s [[Mustafar system]] was part of the spur<ref name="BTMF17" /> which linked Mustafar to the Rimma Trade Route, along which the planet's valuable mineral resources were exported to the rest of [[the galaxy]].<ref name="BTMF29">{{BuildFalconCite|29|Guide to the Galaxy}}</ref>

==Behind the scenes==
The Tosste Spur was mentioned in the new ''[[Star Wars]]'' [[canon]] in the [[2015]] magazine [[Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon 17|''Star Wars: Build the Millennium Falcon'' 17]].<ref name="BTMF17" /> The route originated in the [[Star Wars Legends|''Star Wars'' Legends]] continuity, where it was first mentioned in the [[2009]] reference book ''[[The Essential Atlas]]'', which was written by [[Daniel Wallace]] and [[Jason Fry]].<ref name="Atlas">''[[The Essential Atlas]]''</ref>

